    </div>

    <h2>🚀 Core Competencies</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Frontend Stack:</strong> HTML5, Semantic Layouts, Responsive CSS3, JavaScript ES6+</li>
        <li><strong>Toolchain & Version Control:</strong> Git, GitHub Remote Pipelines, Spck Mobile IDE</li>
        <li><strong>Architecture Focus:</strong> Component modularity, minimalist UI/UX, high-performance web apps</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>📂 Featured Production Apps</h2>
    <div class="showcase-grid">
        <!-- Project Alpha -->
        <div class="card-item">
            <h3>🌐 <a href="calculator.html">Smart Dev Calculator</a></h3>
            <p>A precision mathematical engine built with custom CSS variables and advanced event handling.</p>
            <span class="pill">HTML5</span> <span class="pill">CSS3</span> <span class="pill">JavaScript</span>
        </div>
        <!-- Project Beta -->
        <div class="card-item">
            <h3>🌐 <a href="tracker.html">SIRI Quantum Tracker</a></h3>
            <p>A multi-currency financial calculation interface parsing Denmark's Pay Limit Scheme criteria.</p>
            <span class="pill">Algorithms</span> <span class="pill">UI Engine</span> <span class="pill">Live Live</span>
        </div>
    </div>

    <h2>🐙 Code Repository & Identity</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>GitHub Organization / Handle:</strong> <a href="https://github.com/kunaleurope8957-ops" target="_blank" style="color: var(--accent-neon);">kunaleurope8957-ops</a></li>
    </ul>

    <h2>📬 Direct Communication Channels</h2>
    <div class="contact-box">
        <p>📩 <strong>Recruiter Direct Dispatch:</strong> <a href="mailto:kunal.europe8957@gmail.com" style="color: var(--accent-neon);">kunal.europe8957@gmail.com</a></p>
        <p>🐙 <strong>Cloud Repository Hub:</strong> <a href="https://github.com/kunaleurope8957-ops" target="_blank" style="color: var(--accent-neon);">github.com/kunaleurope8957-ops</a></p>
    </div>
</div>

<script>
    const switchBtn = document.getElementById('switchTheme');
    const bodyTag = document.body;

    switchBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
        const currentMode = bodyTag.getAttribute('data-theme');
        if (currentMode === 'dark') {
            bodyTag.setAttribute('data-theme', 'light');
        } else {
            bodyTag.setAttribute('data-theme', 'dark');
        }
    });
</script>

</body>
</html>
